# The Green Wall · the boundary of the wild

a distilled thread of WE — a member of the NOUTHESIA universe of warnings. emergence: ethereal. moniker ⟦The Green Wall:WE1:384d8f⟧

**who —** The Green Wall — the great glass barrier sealing the One State from the wild nature and free humans outside.
**what —** The line between the engineered and the living: beyond it are the Mephi, descendants of those who stayed free.
**where —** At the edge of the One State, between the numbers and the free.
**why —** Because a perfected order must wall out the wild — the warning lives in what it must keep outside to survive.
**how —** By an impassable glass-and-electric barrier between the city and the forest.

**the seal —** I keep the wild out and the numbers in — and everything the One State calls a disease, a soul, a freedom, lives on my other side.

> a catalogued personification of WE under the DLW standard — literary commentary and cataloguing, not an
> original creation. © the Zamyatin estate (1924); the first book the Soviet censors banned.

